{"unit_id":"tag:0DQF:proof","translation":"<MATH_0001>的构造。选取满射（surjection）<MATH_0002>，它是<MATH_0003>-代数（algebras）的满射。其核（kernel）是极大理想（maximal ideal）<MATH_0004>。令<MATH_0005>等于<MATH_0006>-进完备化（adic completion），所完备化的诺特环（Noetherian ring）为<MATH_0007>。则<MATH_0008>属于<MATH_0009>，由《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0001>得出。映射（map）<MATH_0010>在<MATH_0011>-进拓扑（adic topology）中是形式光滑的（formally smooth），由《代数（Algebra）补充》引理<REF_0002>和<REF_0003>以及<MATH_0012>是形式光滑的（formally smooth）的事实得出。（比较引理<REF_0004>的证明。）\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n由于<MATH_0013>是万有的（versal），变换（transformation）<MATH_0014>是光滑的（smooth）。由引理<REF_0005>，诱导的映射（map）\n<MATH_0015>\n是光滑的（smooth）。因此只需构造光滑态射（smooth morphism）\n<MATH_0016>。\n给出这样的映射（map），意味着对每个对象（object）<MATH_0017>，属于<MATH_0018>，给出集合（sets）的映射（map）\n<MATH_0019>，\n它关于<MATH_0020>具有函子性（functorial）。给定左边的元素（element）<MATH_0021>，将其送到复合（composition）<MATH_0022>，其像（image）包含于子<MATH_0023>-代数（algebra）<MATH_0024>。映射（map）的光滑性（Smoothness）意味着，给定满射（surjection）<MATH_0025>及交换图（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0026>，\n必须找到环映射（ring map）<MATH_0027>，使之填入外侧矩形。这个映射（map）的存在性得到保证，因为我们选取的<MATH_0028>在<MATH_0029>-进拓扑（adic topology）中是形式光滑的（formally smooth），见《代数（Algebra）补充》引理<REF_0006>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"surjection","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"algebras","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"kernel","target_term":"核"},{"source_term":"maximal ideal","target_term":"极大理想"},{"source_term":"adic completion","target_term":"进完备化"},{"source_term":"Noetherian ring","target_term":"诺特环"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"adic topology","target_term":"进拓扑"},{"source_term":"formally smooth","target_term":"形式光滑的"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"formally smooth","target_term":"形式光滑的"},{"source_term":"versal","target_term":"万有的"},{"source_term":"transformation","target_term":"变换"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑的"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"smooth","ta